Implemented in commit 6d8a51e.

Changes:
- CreateVillager conversion now plays celebration/level-up sounds plus HAPPY_VILLAGER, ENCHANT, and GLOW particles.
- A gold/bold chat message is broadcast when a normal villager becomes a CreateVillager.
- Iron golem spawns now play iron golem/anvil sounds plus CLOUD, CRIT, and ELECTRIC_SPARK particles, with no chat message.
- The CreateVillager name tag is now bold gold.
- Updated README feature notes.

Validation: ./build.sh completed successfully with Java 25 (BUILD SUCCESSFUL), and the updated JAR was copied to dist/ and test-server/mods/. No runtime server test was run in this environment.
